      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jacksonville%2C_Texas",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Cherokee Sanitarium, founded in 1919, later became Newburn Memorial Hospital and served Jacksonville for decades.",
